2. Unit test: Non-overlapping spans, verify no detection.
3. Unit test: Fudge factor: 1-byte overlap with fudge=2, verify no detection.
4. Unit test: Threshold: 4 overlaps with max=5, verify no flag. 5 overlaps -> flag.
5. Integration test: Build a zip with overlapping local file headers (may require hand-crafted bytes). Verify telemetry emitted.

