**Path 2 — UTF-16 (lines ~744-765):** Inside for_each_capture_match closure in run_rule_on_utf16_window_aligned. Same pattern: entropy on decoded[span.clone()] → then extract. Swap to: extract first → entropy on secret_bytes.

**Path 3 — Raw _into (lines ~918-941):** Inside for_each_capture_match closure in run_rule_on_raw_window_into. Same pattern. Swap order.

**Path 4 — UTF-16 _into (lines ~1145-1164):** Inside for_each_capture_match closure in run_rule_on_utf16_window_into. Same pattern. Swap order.

**Module doc (lines 1-23):** Update step 4 description from "Apply entropy gates on the *full match* (group 0)" to "Apply entropy gates on the *extracted secret* (capture group)". Step 5 (extract secret span) moves before step 4 conceptually, so renumber steps 4 and 5.

