## Problem

max_inflation_ratio = 1 makes the ratio probe cap the first read to 1 byte (because remaining_decompressed_allowance_with_ratio_probe() assumes comp_in = 1 for the first read). This effectively breaks all compressed entry scanning. No validation catches this footgun.

Similarly, max_inflation_ratio = 0 disables ratio tracking entirely, which may be intentional but should be documented.

