## Implementation Guide

Location: validate() in config.rs, after the existing 8 invariant checks (~line 245).

```rust
// The ratio probe assumes comp_in=1 for the first read, so ratio=1 means
// the first decompressed read is capped at 1 byte. This causes every
// compressed entry to immediately hit the ratio cap, making compressed
// scanning effectively non-functional.
if self.max_inflation_ratio == 1 {
    return Err(ArchiveConfigError::InflationRatioTooLow);
}
```

