}
```

Alternative approach (warn instead of error): If max_inflation_ratio = 1 is needed for edge cases (e.g., testing), use tracing::warn! instead of returning an error. But the plan recommends hard error since ratio=1 is never useful in production.

Existing validation pattern (config.rs:194-245): Each check returns Err(ArchiveConfigError::Variant). The new check follows the same pattern.

