## Why DeflateDecoder::reset() Does Not Work

DeflateDecoder<R> has reset(&mut self, r: R) -> R, but the reader type CountedRead<LimitedRead<'a, R>> has a lifetime 'a that changes per entry (borrows from ZipCursor). Cannot store DeflateDecoder across entries because the borrow expires.

